      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name} For example, it is natural to expect that pickup objects will become inactive in a VRC Object Pool.\n\nAs for network sync, I think this is officially taken into account, as it is reflected when the object becomes active again.",
